OL,3,GNEWSADeadly virus found in Wiltshire as
OL,4,Avaccines needed
OL,5,
OL,6,FWiltshire has recorded two cases of
OL,7,Fbluetongue, a virus which can be deadly
OL,8,Fin livestock, amid reports of a vaccine
OL,9,Fshortage.
OL,11,FCases of the insect-borne virus, which
OL,12,Faffects sheep and cattle as well as
OL,13,Fother animals, have risen to 630 across
OL,14,FEngland, Wales and Scotland since the
OL,15,Foutbreak began in July.
OL,17,FMelanie McPherson from Avon Farm Vets
OL,18,Fin Chippenham said they were
OL,19,F"struggling to get hold of vaccines"
OL,20,Fand had not had a delivery for two
OL,21,Fweeks.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
