OL,3,GNEWSADeadly virus found in Wiltshire as
OL,4,Avaccines needed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department of Environment, Food and
OL,7,FRural Affairs (Defra) said it was
OL,8,F"working with vaccine manufacturers" to
OL,9,Fincrease supplies.
